\newlabel{fig:citation_decomp_by_query_type}{{17}{34}{Citation decomposition (tool-search relevance and response-citation relevance) by query type. Top row: tool-search relevance; bottom row: response-citation relevance. The performance gap between agents is most visible on comprehensive report queries, where \textsc {Researcher}'s broader retrieval strategy produces higher relevance across both sub-metrics}{figure.caption.40}{}}
