\newlabel{tab:cost_breakdown}{{20}{35}{Dollar-cost breakdown per tenant run, derived from logged token counts at Azure list prices. \emph {Agent \$}: cost of the agent loop. \emph {Judge \$}: amortised cost of the four GPT-4o judge calls. \emph {Total \$}: sum. \emph {\$/100}: cost per 100 evaluation cases}{table.caption.41}{}}
